01:14:25.836 --> 01:14:27.087
[grunhe]

01:14:28.046 --> 01:14:29.089
[grunhe]

01:14:29.590 --> 01:14:30.757
Ki-jung, parado!

01:14:30.841 --> 01:14:32.634
Um movimento, e eu atiro. Mandei parar!

01:14:34.511 --> 01:14:35.762
[ruído do taser]

01:14:39.475 --> 01:14:40.684
